  "post_title": "Magníficos conciertos en el Festival Rellamp de Onda por El Salvador",
  "post_date": "2014-08-03 11:04:02",
  "post_name": "magnificos-conciertos-en-el-festival-rellamp-de-onda-por-el-salvador",
  "autor": "redaccion",
  "imagen_destacada_id": "NULL",
  "categorias": "Cultura y Espectáculos|Fiestas|Noticias",
  "post_content": "<p>La pista exterior del Pabell&oacute;n Municipal de Onda ha acogido la noche de este s&aacute;bado una nueva edici&oacute;n del Festival Rellamp, con tres magn&iacute;ficos conciertos, organizados por esta Asociaci&oacute;n con la colaboraci&oacute;n del &aacute;rea de Participaci&oacute;n Ciudadana del Ayuntamiento, dentro de las fiestas del Salvador.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2014/08/IMG_3733.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>Han abierto el fuego los jovenc&iacute;simos Capazo de Asfalto, grupo a caballo entre Onda y Castell&oacute;.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2014/08/IMG_3754.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>Desde la capital de la Plana, pero con mayor&iacute;a de componenetes procedentes de Onda, Dusting ha interpretado excelentes versiones de cl&aacute;sicos del rock.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2014/08/IMG_3785.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>Han cerrado la velada los ondenses The Autan Plus Band y su punk-rock, que ha contado con varias colaboraciones espont&aacute;neas a lo largo de la actuaci&oacute;n, como la de componentes de la Orkesta Pelillo.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertsrellampsalvador14/img_3732.jpg\" alt=\"img_3732\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertsrellampsalvador14/img_3733.jpg\" alt=\"img_3733\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertsrellampsalvador14/img_3734.jpg\" alt=\"img_3734\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertsrellampsalvador14/img_3735.jpg\" alt=\"img_3735\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertsrellampsalvador14/img_3736.jpg\" alt=\"img_3736\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertsrellampsalvador14/img_3737.jpg\" alt=\"img_3737\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertsrellampsalvador14/img_3738.jpg\" alt=\"img_3738\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertsrellampsalvador14/img_3740.jpg\" alt=\"img_3740\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertsrellampsalvador14/img_3741.jpg\" alt=\"img_3741\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertsrellampsalvador14/img_3742.jpg\" alt=\"img_3742\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertsrellampsalvador14/img_3743.jpg\" alt=\"img_3743\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertsrellampsalvador14/img_3745.jpg\" alt=\"img_3745\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertsrellampsalvador14/img_3746.jpg\" alt=\"img_3746\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertsrellampsalvador14/img_3748.jpg\" alt=\"img_3748\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertsrellampsalvador14/img_3749.jpg\" alt=\"img_3749\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertsrellampsalvador14/img_3750.jpg\" alt=\"img_3750\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https: